ed acpi_put_table() to fix memory leak {CVE-2022-50824}\n- net: stmmac: fix possible memory leak in stmmac_dvr_probe() {CVE-2022-50663}\n- bpf: Fix reference state management for synchronous callbacks {CVE-2022-50650}\n- blk-mq: fix tags leak when shrink nr_hw_queues {CVE-2023-54227}\n- usbnet: Run unregister_netdev() before unbind() again {CVE-2022-49501}\n- scsi: core: Wake up the error handler when final completions race against each other {CVE-2026-23110}\n- scsi: core: Move scsi_host_busy() out of host lock for waking up EH handler\n- perf/core: Prevent VMA split of buffer mappings {CVE-2025-38563}\n- Bluetooth: L2CAP: Fix accepting multiple L2CAP_ECRED_CONN_REQ {CVE-2026-23395}\n- Bluetooth: L2CAP: Fix responding with wrong PDU type\n- netfilter: nf_tables: release flowtable after rcu grace period on error {CVE-2026-23392}","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bpftool","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/bpftool?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.0.0-284.1101.el9_2.tuxcare.11.els11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1786761805.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/kernel?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-284.1101.el9_2.tuxcare.11.els11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1786761805.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-64k","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/kernel-64k?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.14.0-284.1101.el9_2.tuxcare.11.els11"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1786761805.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kern